<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Strategist Intelligence Hub</title>

<style>
* {
  margin: 0;
  padding: 0;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
  font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  background: #0F2D22;
  color: #F6F1E6;
}

/* HERO */
.hero {
  padding: 4rem 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  background: linear-gradient(180deg, #12392C, #0F2D22);
  border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(246,241,230,0.15);
}

.hero h1 {
  font-size: 2.6rem;
  margin-bottom: 1rem;
}

.hero p {
  max-width: 700px;
  margin: 0 auto 2rem;
  opacity: 0.9;
}

.btn {
  background: #F6F1E6;
  color: #0F2D22;
  padding: 0.8rem 1.4rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  font-weight: 600;
  border: none;
  cursor: pointer;
}

/* CONTAINER */
.container {
  max-width: 1100px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 2rem;
}

/* GRID SECTIONS */
.grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.5rem;
  margin-top: 2rem;
}

/* CARDS */
.card {
  background: #163C2F;
  border-radius: 16px;
  overflow: hidden;
  border: 1px solid rgba(246,241,230,0.15);
  transition: 0.3s;
}

.card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.card img {
  width: 100%;
  height: 150px;
  object-fit: cover;
}

.card-content {
  padding: 1rem;
}

.card h3 {
  margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}

.card p {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  opacity: 0.85;
}

/* SECTION TITLE */
.section-title {
  margin-top: 3rem;
  font-size: 1.4rem;
}

/* FOOTER CTA */
.cta {
  text-align: center;
  padding: 3rem 2rem;
  margin-top: 4rem;
  border-top: 1px solid rgba(246,241,230,0.15);
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- HERO -->
<div class="hero">
  <h1>Strategist Intelligence Hub</h1>
  <p>
    A structured system for analyzing opportunities, networks, capital flows, and global positioning strategies.
  </p>

  <button class="btn">Enter System</button>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <h2 class="section-title">Core Intelligence Fields</h2>

  <div class="grid">

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520607162513-77705c0f0d4a" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Global Opportunities</h3>
        <p>Residency strategies, market entry systems, and international expansion paths.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521737604893-d14cc237f11d" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Network Intelligence</h3>
        <p>Filtering high-value relationships and eliminating low-signal communication.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-8d04cb21cd6c" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Capital Systems</h3>
        <p>Income layering, asset compounding, and financial structure design.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529070538774-1843cb3265df" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Strategic Mobility</h3>
        <p>Location independence and global optimization frameworks.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

  <h2 class="section-title">Featured Intelligence Nodes</h2>

  <div class="grid">

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Intent Filtering Protocol</h3>
        <p>Only high-intent communication enters your decision system.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1521791136064-7986c2920216" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Digital Residency Model</h3>
        <p>Build global business presence without geographic dependency.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1551288049-bebda4e38f71" alt="">
      <div class="card-content">
        <h3>Income Layering Engine</h3>
        <p>Multiple independent revenue streams working in parallel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>

</div>

<div class="cta">
  <h2>Build Strategic Clarity</h2>
  <p>Turn decisions into structured intelligence systems.</p>
</div>

</body>
</html>
